constexpr BossText kBossTextEn[13] = {
    {0x7f, "A warrior confronted in the\nFlooded Prison tier. Well-\nversed in combat tech-\nniques, making her a deadly\nopponent. After the fight,\nshe mumbled something to\nHugo about \"Darklings\"\nbefore escaping."},
    {0x80, "A massive beast\nconfronted in the Wailing\nBlue tier. It can deliver\nblows of incredible force\nwith its long arms and\nboasts a shell capable of\ndeflecting any attack. It\nwas the leader of the\ndemons that assaulted Ys."},
    {0x83, "A huge, wormlike creature\nthat rules over the Flooded\nPrison tier. Its tough head\nis followed by many\nsegments, with countless\nskittering legs. In addition\nto the threat of trampling,\nit also spews bolts of\nelectricity."},
    {0x86, "A bizarre, gargantuan\nconstruct that rules over\nthe Guilty Fire tier. Its\nsolid head and tough skin\nare designed to impart\nmaximum torment on foes.\nIt's been shackled to\nprevent it from going on a\nmad rampage."},
    {0x87, "A summoned demon of\nremarkable ugliness,\nencountered in Rado's\nAnnex. Sends out bodily\nprojections that surround\nits enemies. Attacks merci-\nlessly, but a dedicated\nopponent should be able to\ndefeat it."},
    {0x89, "A mantis-like demon that\nrules over the Blighted\nBlood tier. Its keen\neyesight and quick\nmovement enable it to\nattack with deadly precision.\nIt has an extremely cruel\nnature, taking great pleasure\nin hacking its prey to pieces."},
    {0x8a, "A Darkling warrior\nconfronted in the Demonic\nCore tier. Devoted all of\nher energy to gaining\npower, now exhibiting far\nmore varied, rapid and\noverall dangerous\ntechniques than ever\nbefore."},
    {0x8b, "A Darkling warrior\nconfronted in the Demonic\nCore tier. After learning\nthat Epona is this man's\nyounger sister, he and\nHugo engaged in a fierce\nbattle. Once Hugo\ndemonstrated his strength,\nKishgal silently withdrew."},
    {0x8f, "Dalles, transformed into the\nultimate demon after taking\ncontrol of the demonic\nessence. Possesses\nimmense magic power and\nwill annihilate all who\noppose him -- but can\nnever truly be satisfied,\nalways thirsting for more."},
    {0x90, "Galleon, now confronted as\nan enemy. His aim was to\nknock some sense into the\ntraitor who appeared before\nhim with mind corrupted by\ndemonic energy. But in the\nend, this goal proved\nunreachable. The power\ndivide was just too great."},
    {0x92, "Shion, now confronted as\nan enemy. Said to be nearly\nas powerful as the Six\nPriests themselves, he's\nwilling to take on anyone\nwho would dare attack the\nGoddesses. The battle was\nrough, but in the end, Toal\nemerged as the victor."},
    {0x93, "A Darkling warrior,\nconfronted in the Demonic\nCore tier. Discarded his\nhumanity for a final battle\nroyale with Toal. Though\nhe'd been defeated once\nbefore, his demonic\nrampage granted him\nnear-invincibility."},
    {0x95, "The ultimate evolution of\nthe demonic essence.\nTranscending all reason\nand wielding the darkest\npower, it confronted Toal.\nIn the end, it was defeated\nat the blade of the Silver\nSword and sealed away\nwithin the Black Pearl."},
};

